# {{lb|en|rare}} Capable, agile, or active.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1562|author=w:George Cavendish|title=The Life of Cardinal Wolsey
|passage=Therefore my policy and advice shall be this: That about the dead time of the night, when our enemies be most quiet at rest, there shall issue from us a number of the most '''deliverest''' soldiers to assault their camp; who shall give the assault right secretly, even directly against the entry of the camp, which is almost invincible.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1887|author=w:William Minto|title=The Mediation of Ralph Hardelot
|passage="More skillful!" interrupted the host. "He is the most '''deliver''' at that exercise I have ever set eyes on."}}

